{
 "duration": 25.781,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Jess had waterproof boots, but every fall hike ended with wet socks.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.448
  },
  {
   "text": "Mud, wet leaves and little stones kept sliding in over the top.",
   "start": 4.698,
   "end": 8.502
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 8.852,
   "end": 9.779
  },
  {
   "text": "Leg gaiters.",
   "start": 10.079,
   "end": 10.946
  },
  {
   "text": "They wrap from your laces up your shin, and cover the gap between boot and pants.",
   "start": 11.146,
   "end": 15.468
  },
  {
   "text": "Rain, mud and debris slide off instead of falling in.",
   "start": 15.718,
   "end": 18.758
  },
  {
   "text": "Jess hit the muddiest trail of the season, and came home with dry feet.",
   "start": 19.158,
   "end": 23.222
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next muddy hike.",
   "start": 23.622,
   "end": 25.581
  }
 ],
